  ],
  "evidence": [
    "Pinned site_set591B50 and rocky_set591BC0 load CL from int argument then byte-shift; current signed-int shifts can overflow or shift negative values before narrowing. code_set591E00 uses SHL ECX,24 and requires modulo32 unsigned expression. lock_set masks to7 before shift and is excluded. Preserve historical shape/exact obligations; scoped native measurement, actual-source boundary/damage tests and full build/link required."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover original byte and unsigned operand semantics in site_set, rocky_set and code_set without changing signatures, claims, storage or error paths.",
